# 🧠 Memory MCP - Graphiti Integration (MANDATORY)

## **🚨 CRITICAL REQUIREMENT**

### **Every Development Action MUST Update Knowledge Graph**
- **NEVER** complete a task without documenting in Graphiti
- **ALWAYS** capture implementation decisions
- **ALWAYS** link new knowledge to existing entities
- **ALWAYS** store reusable patterns

## **📋 Mandatory Integration Patterns**

### **1. Task Initiation Pattern**
```typescript
// REQUIRED: Start every development session
const currentTask = mcp_taskmaster-ai_next_task()

// REQUIRED: Search existing knowledge BEFORE implementing
const relatedNodes = mcp_graphiti-memory_search_memory_nodes(currentTask.title)
const relatedFacts = mcp_graphiti-memory_search_memory_facts(currentTask.description)
const similarPatterns = mcp_qdrant_qdrant-find(`similar to ${currentTask.description}`)
```

### **2. Implementation Documentation Pattern**
```typescript
// REQUIRED: Document during implementation
mcp_graphiti-memory_add_memory({
  name: `${currentTask.title} - Implementation Progress`,
  episode_body: `
    Task: ${currentTask.title}
    Phase: Implementation
    Approach: [specific technical approach]
    Files modified: [list of files]
    Key decisions: [architectural choices made]
    Challenges encountered: [problems and solutions]
    Dependencies discovered: [new dependencies found]
  `,
  source: "text"
})
```

### **3. Cross-System Integration Pattern**
```typescript
// REQUIRED: Link systems and components
mcp_graphiti-memory_add_memory({
  name: "System Integration Point",
  episode_body: JSON.stringify({
    component: "ComponentName",
    database_tables: ["table1", "table2"],
    api_endpoints: ["/api/endpoint"],
    business_process: "ProcessName",
    implementation_details: "specific technical approach",
    related_tasks: [currentTask.id],
    integration_type: "database|api|ui|business_logic"
  }),
  source: "json"
})
```

### **4. Bug Fix Documentation Pattern**
```typescript
// REQUIRED: Document all bug fixes
mcp_graphiti-memory_add_memory({
  name: `Bug Fix: ${bugTitle}`,
  episode_body: `
    Bug: ${bugDescription}
    Root cause: ${rootCause}
    Solution: ${solutionImplemented}
    Files changed: ${filesModified}
    Prevention: ${preventionStrategy}
    Related systems: ${affectedSystems}
  `,
  source: "text"
})
```

### **5. Feature Completion Pattern**
```typescript
// REQUIRED: Document completed features
mcp_graphiti-memory_add_memory({
  name: `Feature Complete: ${featureName}`,
  episode_body: JSON.stringify({
    feature: featureName,
    implementation_approach: "detailed technical approach",
    components_created: ["Component1", "Component2"],
    apis_integrated: ["/api/endpoint1", "/api/endpoint2"],
    database_changes: ["table1", "table2"],
    business_value: "specific business outcome",
    testing_strategy: "how feature was validated",
    deployment_notes: "deployment considerations"
  }),
  source: "json"
})
```

## **🔄 Knowledge Graph Workflow Integration**

### **Development Session Flow**
```typescript
// 1. INITIATE: Get task and search knowledge
const task = mcp_taskmaster-ai_next_task()
const knowledge = mcp_graphiti-memory_search_memory_nodes(task.title)

// 2. PLAN: Document implementation plan
mcp_graphiti-memory_add_memory({
  name: `${task.title} - Planning`,
  episode_body: "Implementation plan based on existing knowledge..."
})

// 3. IMPLEMENT: Code the solution
// ... your implementation work ...

// 4. DOCUMENT: Update knowledge graph (MANDATORY)
mcp_graphiti-memory_add_memory({
  name: `${task.title} - Implementation`,
  episode_body: "Detailed implementation findings..."
})

// 5. CORRELATE: Link to other systems
mcp_graphiti-memory_add_memory({
  name: "System Integration",
  episode_body: JSON.stringify({...integrationDetails}),
  source: "json"
})

// 6. FINALIZE: Update task status
mcp_taskmaster-ai_set_task_status({id: task.id, status: "done"})
```

### **Knowledge Linking Patterns**
```typescript
// REQUIRED: Always link new knowledge to existing entities
// Search for related entities BEFORE adding new memory
const relatedEntities = mcp_graphiti-memory_search_memory_nodes("related concept")

// Add new memory with explicit relationships
mcp_graphiti-memory_add_memory({
  name: "New Implementation",
  episode_body: `
    This implementation extends: ${relatedEntities.map(e => e.name).join(', ')}
    New patterns established: [specific patterns]
    Architectural decisions: [decisions made]
    Future considerations: [what to consider next]
  `
})
```

